# Custom shop themes live here and MUST be version-controlled — the upstream
# Bagisto default of ignoring everything ("*") would drop the whole theme from
# the repo, so a fresh clone/deploy would fall back to the stock theme.
#
# Only dependencies and build noise are excluded; theme sources (views, assets,
# tailwind/vite config) are tracked.

# The root .gitignore drops package-lock.json globally; re-include it here so
# production builds can use `npm ci` and get the exact dependency tree.
!package-lock.json

node_modules/
.vite/
*.hot
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
